
# Hospital Patient Management System

## SQL Server — Aggregate Functions

### Project Overview
This module demonstrates SQL Server aggregate functions using hospital data.

### Functions Covered
- COUNT()
- SUM()
- AVG()
- MIN()
- MAX()

### Business Use Cases
- Count registered patients.
- Count doctors and appointments.
- Calculate total billing and payments.
- Calculate average bill amounts.
- Identify minimum and maximum bill amounts.

